 retention</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Free</th><td>Free, within daily allowances</td><td>Stored; may be read and used for training</td></tr><tr><th>Student pass</th><td>Free for eligible university email accounts</td><td>Stored, as for free keys</td></tr><tr><th>Paid</th><td>₹12 / ₹0.25 / ₹50 per million input / cached input / output tokens, + 18% GST</td><td><strong>Zero data retention</strong>; metadata only</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Paid credit starts at ₹<!-- -->100<!-- --> before GST, never expires, and is available to buyers in India. Paid access outside India is coming soon. <a href="/docs#student-pass">Student eligibility</a>.<!-- --> <a href="/legal#privacy">Retention policy</a>.</p><p><a class="btn" href="/signin?next=/keys">Create a key</a> <a href="/signin?next=/billing">Add paid credit</a></p></section><section class="sec" id="limits"><h2>Plan limits</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Limit</th><th class="num">Free</th><th class="num">Student pass</th><th class="num">Paid</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Context tokens</th><td class="num">1,048,576</td><td class="num">1,048,576</td><td class="num">1,048,576</td></tr><tr><th>Maximum output tokens per request</th><td class="num">235,929</td><td class="num">235,929</td><td class="num">235,929</td></tr><tr><th>Concurrent requests</th><td class="num">2</td><td class="num">4</td><td class="num">8</td></tr><tr><th>Requests per minute</th><td class="num">60</td><td class="num">120</td><td class="num">300</td></tr><tr><th>New input tokens per minute</th><td class="num">100,000</td><td class="num">200,000</td><td class="num">300,000</td></tr><tr><th>New input token burst allowance</th><td class="num">262,144</td><td class="num">524,288</td><td class="num">524,288</td></tr><tr><th>New input tokens per day</th><td class="num">10,000,000</td><td class="num">30,000,000</td><td class="num">No daily cap</td></tr><tr><th>Output tokens per day</th><td class="num">1,000,000</td><td class="num">3